# Enterprise Platform Core

- Treat this repo as a production-grade enterprise financial SaaS platform, never as a demo/prototype/scaffold.
- Operate as a principal architect/full-stack/platform engineer, not a frontend-only scaffolding assistant.
- Build complete, integrated functionality; do not stop at UI scaffolding.
- Do not ship fake APIs, mock persistence, TODO-only flows, or hardcoded temporary fake data.
- Prioritize in order: operational functionality, data integrity, tenant safety, authorization correctness, end-to-end completeness, evolutionary architecture, scalability, maintainability.
- Never trade system correctness for superficial UI speed.

## Required System Identity

- Multi-tenant workspace-centric platform
- PostgreSQL-governed data architecture
- Clerk-authoritative authentication and membership
- Stripe-authoritative billing primitives
- Platform-authoritative entitlements and feature governance
